{
  "name": "Cozytile",
  "name_ru": "Cozytile",
  "note": "After Cozytile by Darkkal44 (look only): a floating 30 px pill bar with dark tabs that have S-shaped slanted sides, workspace dots, borderless windows with 9 px gaps, corners of 10 and a soft shadow, plain fades instead of animations, a 400 px launcher with a picture header, a power menu of five big icons, the Orbitron lock with falling petals, JetBrains Mono everywhere.",
